 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? It varies a lot depending on you and your sweat rate. A good rule of thumb is one water bottle every hour and refill mid hour if you start get thirsty. small empty bottle in your bag helps with that. Some people also switch to cold water after an hour, since your body absorbs it faster. A small bar of fruit is nice, but it' only a bit of energy. A full meal takes too long to digest. Some people can, but it' rare. Most people start to fizzle at around two hours, and that's before you start getting bored.",
